  "description": "The achievement **First Blood** (type: achievement, ID\u202f=\u202fachv1, content ID\u202f=\u202fachvcnt1) rewards players for recording their first kill in battle. Its description reads \u201cEarn your first kill in battle,\u201d and it is represented by the icon at\u202fhttps://example.com/icons/firstblood.png. This combat\u2011focused achievement is currently enabled and belongs to the **Combat** category (category ID\u202f=\u202fcat1, content ID\u202f=\u202fcatcnt1), which uses the icon\u202fhttps://example.com/icons/combat.png and carries an order value of\u202f1. The base reward notes for the achievement are: \u201cBase achievement reward details.\u201d No prerequisite levels are required.\n\nFirst Blood progresses through two levels. The first level (ID\u202f=\u202flvl1, content ID\u202f=\u202fcnt1) is unlocked at a threshold of\u202f10 kills and grants 100\u202fXP; it does not include any requisition packs (reward ID\u202f=\u202freward1, content ID\u202f=\u202frcontent1). The second level (ID\u202f=\u202flvl2, content ID\u202f=\u202fcnt2) activates at\u202f20 kills, awarding 250\u202fXP plus a single requisition pack. The pack, named **Elite Weapon Pack**, is described as \u201cA set of elite weapons for seasoned fighters,\u201d displayed with the image\u202fhttps://example.com/packs/elite-weapon.png. It is featured, not new, costs 499 credits, can be purchased with credits, is not available from the marketplace, has a merchandising order of\u202f5, and carries the IDs pack1 (content ID\u202f=\u202fpackcnt1). This reward is recorded under reward ID\u202f=\u202freward2, content ID\u202f=\u202frcontent2.",
